      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You should not have to tip the entire dishwasher over to fix this issue. Most Bosch models allow you to access the lower base and sump area by removing the bottom rack and possibly the lower spray arm. Carefully pivot or remove panels in the kickplate area, if possible, to gain enough access to drain the tray without fully pulling the unit out. Prying panels requires caution to avoid breaking any internal seals.",
